  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 0.25,
      "e": 4.42,
      "text": "- Craig Radelman, C-R-A-I-G R-A-D-E-L-M-A-N."
    },
    {
      "s": 5.95,
      "e": 9.12,
      "text": "- [Interviewer] And what's your title?"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.48,
      "e": 12.12,
      "text": "- I'm Deputy Fire Chief for City of Miami Fire Department."
    },
    {
      "s": 12.12,
      "e": 15.81,
      "text": "On this mission I'm deploying as a Task Force Leader."
    },
    {
      "s": 15.81,
      "e": 17.62,
      "text": "Well, we're going down to Puerto Rico"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.62,
      "e": 21.7,
      "text": "ahead of Hurricane Maria to be prepared to deploy"
    },
    {
      "s": 22.15,
      "e": 25.04,
      "text": "immediately after the storm comes through."
    },
    {
      "s": 25.04,
      "e": 26.95,
      "text": "Right now it's looking like it's gonna make landfall"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.95,
      "e": 28.38,
      "text": "as a cat three or cat four,"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.38,
      "e": 30.56,
      "text": "so there could be some serious damage,"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.56,
      "e": 32.39,
      "text": "and we want to be in there early"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.39,
      "e": 33.98,
      "text": "so that we can go ahead and do as much good"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.98,
      "e": 37.4,
      "text": "as possible for the people of the island."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.63,
      "e": 40.69,
      "text": "It always kind of gets you up on edge"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.69,
      "e": 43.31,
      "text": "and you're excited to go down there"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.31,
      "e": 45.01,
      "text": "and you want to do good and help out,"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.01,
      "e": 47.42,
      "text": "but you know there's gonna be some bad"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.42,
      "e": 48.54,
      "text": "destruction down there and you don't"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.54,
      "e": 51.46,
      "text": "want to see that happen to anybody."
    },
    {
      "s": 51.69,
      "e": 53.96,
      "text": "We've been through a lot of it down here recently"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.96,
      "e": 55.39,
      "text": "with Irma and some of the other storms"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.39,
      "e": 56.23,
      "text": "that have come through."
    },
    {
      "s": 56.23,
      "e": 57.06,
      "text": "So, it's been tough."
    },
    {
      "s": 57.06,
      "e": 58.9,
      "text": "It's been a tough year."
    },
    {
      "s": 58.9,
      "e": 60.44,
      "text": "Working with Homestead Air Force Base is great."
    },
    {
      "s": 60.44,
      "e": 61.77,
      "text": "We've had a great working relationship"
    },
    {
      "s": 61.77,
      "e": 62.62,
      "text": "with them over the years."
    },
    {
      "s": 62.62,
      "e": 64.05,
      "text": "We've come down here many times,"
    },
    {
      "s": 64.05,
      "e": 65.86,
      "text": "done a lot of training with them,"
    },
    {
      "s": 65.86,
      "e": 67.83,
      "text": "and deploying out of here,"
    },
    {
      "s": 67.83,
      "e": 70.09,
      "text": "they make it real easy for us."
    },
    {
      "s": 70.09,
      "e": 72.48,
      "text": "It's a real good place to be."
    },
    {
      "s": 72.48,
      "e": 73.39,
      "text": "- [Interviewer] Awesome."
    },
    {
      "s": 73.39,
      "e": 75.61,
      "text": "So you work for the city of Miami."
    },
    {
      "s": 75.61,
      "e": 76.44,
      "text": "- Correct."
    },
    {
      "s": 76.44,
      "e": 77.76,
      "text": "- [Interviewer] But you're also working with"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.76,
      "e": 78.98,
      "text": "FEMA, is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "s": 78.98,
      "e": 80.4,
      "text": "- That's correct."
    },
    {
      "s": 80.58,
      "e": 82.7,
      "text": "Florida Task Force Two is one of 20"
    },
    {
      "s": 82.7,
      "e": 85.64,
      "text": "federal task forces and sponsoring agency"
    },
    {
      "s": 85.64,
      "e": 87.87,
      "text": "is the City of Miami Fire Department."
    },
    {
      "s": 87.87,
      "e": 90.1,
      "text": "No, we're just looking forward to gettin' down there"
    },
    {
      "s": 90.1,
      "e": 93.18,
      "text": "and do some good for a lot of people."
    },
    {
      "s": 93.39,
